151
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:51,820
But-two-ene is symmetrical, so it gives only butan-two-ol.

152
00:06:51,900 --> 00:06:54,140
So X is but-two-ene.

153
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:56,700
But-one-ene doesn't fit, because it can give two

154
00:06:56,820 --> 00:06:57,580
alcohols.

155
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:01,920
So anything that splits into two pieces, H

156
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:05,360
two, X two, H X or water, can

157
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:07,160
add across a double bond.

158
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:10,000
But what about alkanes, with no double bond

159
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:10,960
to open?

